    <P Name="Name">&lt;!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC &quot;-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.0//EN&quot; &quot;http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40/strict.dtd&quot;&gt;
&lt;html&gt;&lt;head&gt;&lt;meta name=&quot;qrichtext&quot; content=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;&lt;style type=&quot;text/css&quot;&gt;
p, li { white-space: pre-wrap; }
&lt;/style&gt;&lt;/head&gt;&lt;body align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; font-family:&apos;Helvetica&apos;; font-size:10px; font-weight:400; font-style:normal;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12px; font-weight:600; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;HSV-Color Thresholding Module:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:12px; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;This subsystem thresholds a given RGB image based on the desired colour and hue &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px; font-size:12px; font-weight:600;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12px; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Inputs:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;imageRGB 	 				(uint8)		{0,255}			:	Input RGB Image to be thresholded&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;desiredHue 					(int)		{-1}U{0,360}	:	Desired Hue to threshold around (provided in the 0-360 degree range, see the color wheel for hue selection)	&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;																Set the desired hue to -1 if you are interested in thresholding for white		&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;[Sat_min, Val_min] 			(uint8) 		{0,255}			:	Minimum Saturation and Value thresholds&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;[Sat_max, Val_max] 			(uint8) 		{0,255}			:	Maximum Saturation and Value thresholds&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12px; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Outputs:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;imageBinary		 			(uint8)		{0,255}			:	Binary Image (0 or 255 and no other value) representing the thresholding output&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12px; text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Usage:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12px;&quot;&gt;This module can be used when you are interested in thresholding for a certain hue regardless of the luminance. Compared to RGB thresholding which does not work well when the lighting conditions vary, HSV thresholding will correctly threshold for a hue (color) and allow you to specify a broad range of illuminance via the saturation and value thresholds. To broaden the range of hues accepted in the thresholding block, increase the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12px; color:#00b0f0;&quot;&gt;Hue Threshold&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot; font-size:12px;&quot;&gt; parameter. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p align=&quot;left&quot; style=&quot;-qt-paragraph-type:empty; margin-top:0px; margin-bottom:0px; margin-left:0px; margin-right:0px; -qt-block-indent:0; text-indent:0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
